        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A Chinese \"M\" visa is issued for commercial and trade activities. This includes attending trade fairs, visiting clients and factories, and negotiating contracts. It is different from a work visa (Z visa) and requires an invitation letter from a Chinese entity.",
